    /// Parent-side middleware hook. Fires before a request is
    /// forwarded into a facet sub-agent. Mirrors <c>onBeforeConnect</c> /
    /// <c>onBeforeRequest</c>.
    /// <br /><br />
    ///   - return <c>void</c> (default) → forward the original request
    ///   - return <c>Request</c>        → forward this (modified) request
    ///   - return <c>Response</c>       → return this response to the
    ///                               client; do not wake the child
    /// <br /><br />
    /// Default implementation: return void (permissive).
    /// <br /><br />
